  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analysis of Non-Revenue Water Reduction in FDW PPP Projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment supports the analysis of Non-Revenue Water (NRW) reduction approaches implemented in eight projects under the Sustainable Water Fund (FDW) public&#x2013;private partnership programme. The study benchmarks different methodologies used by water utilities in multiple developing countries to reduce physical and commercial water losses, improve financial sustainability, and expand service delivery. The assignment documents lessons learned and provides recommendations to RVO and project partners on effective and scalable NRW reduction strategies that can be sustained by local utilities.</narrative>
  </description>
